menu "AirGradient Sensors"

    config AVERAGING_ITERATION_INTERVAL_MS
        int "Averaging iteration interval (ms)"
        range 100 10000
        default 2000
        help
            Target wall-clock duration of one averaging iteration inside
            SensorManager::start_measures(). Each iteration polls all active
            sensors and then delays until this many milliseconds have elapsed
            since the iteration started. Lower values increase sampling rate
            at the cost of more CPU / I2C traffic and power.

    config SENSOR_WARMUP_DURATION_MS
        int "Sensor warmup total duration (ms)"
        range 0 60000
        default 10000
        help
            Total default duration of SensorManager::warmup_sensor(). The
            default iteration count passed to warmup_sensor() is derived as
            SENSOR_WARMUP_DURATION_MS / SENSOR_WARMUP_INTERVAL_MS. Used to
            condition TVOC/NOx sensors (e.g. SGP41) and spin up PM sensor
            fans/lasers before the first real measurement.

    config SENSOR_WARMUP_INTERVAL_MS
        int "Sensor warmup iteration interval (ms)"
        range 100 10000
        default 1000
        help
            Duration of a single warmup iteration inside
            SensorManager::warmup_sensor(). Each iteration runs one TVOC/NOx
            conditioning cycle and one PM read, then delays until this many
            milliseconds have elapsed since the iteration started.

endmenu
